915
01:25:20.992 --> 01:25:25.873
groups in Session Four. For Explore, write
one question to take to students,

916
01:25:25.873 --> 01:25:30.558
families or the team. An unanswered
question is useful; you don’t need to

917
01:25:30.558 --> 01:25:35.568
