1028
01:34:10.520 --> 01:34:15.420
Here are four options to consider with
your brief in view: executive functioning

1029
01:34:15.421 --> 01:34:20.382
supports, predictability, schedules and
visual supports. The option cards on your

1030
01:34:20.383 --> 01:34:25.221
